                    <p>Success rate at top-tier neurosurgery hospitals</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3>Expert Perspective: Volume and Experience</h3>
            <div class="expert-card">
                <p><strong>Dr. Robert Spetzler</strong>, former director of the Barrow Neurological Institute (Phoenix, Arizona):</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;">"Surgical experience matters enormously in neurosurgery. A surgeon who performs 500 tumor resections annually develops techniques and reflexes that simply cannot be replicated at lower-volume centers. China's top institutions provide this level of exposure."</p>
            </div>

            <h3>Technology at China's Leading Centers</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Intraoperative MRI (iMRI):</strong> Real-time imaging during surgery for maximum tumor removal</li>
                <li><strong>Neuro-navigation systems:</strong> GPS-like precision for tumor localization</li>
                <li><strong>Fluorescence-guided surgery:</strong> 5-ALA dye helps visualize tumor boundaries</li>
                <li><strong>Robotic radiosurgery:</strong> CyberKnife, Gamma Knife Perfexion and Icon systems</li>
                <li><strong>Endoscopic and minimally invasive approaches:</strong> Smaller incisions, faster recovery</li>
                <li><strong>Hybrid operating theaters:</strong> Combining surgical and imaging capabilities</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="highlight">
                <strong>Research Recognition:</strong> Chinese neurosurgeons publish over 8,000 peer-reviewed papers annually in neurosurgery journals, representing 25% of global output. The country has become a leader in skull base surgery, cerebrovascular disease treatment, and radiosurgery innovation.
            </div>

            <!-- SECTION 4: TOP NEUROSURGERY CENTERS IN CHINA -->
            <h2>Section 4: Named Neurosurgery Centers — Where World-Class Care Happens</h2>

            <div class="hospital-card">
